{"seq":1,"slug":"react-structure-for-agents","title":"React Structure For Agents","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-react-codebase/react-structure-for-agents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"component-folder-conventions","title":"组件文件夹与命名约定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-react-codebase/react-structure-for-agents/component-folder-conventions","wordCount":2053,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"feature-based-organization","title":"按功能组织而非按类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-react-codebase/react-structure-for-agents/feature-based-organization","wordCount":2174,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"colocating-related-code","title":"就近放置相关代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-react-codebase/react-structure-for-agents/colocating-related-code","wordCount":1965,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲怎么组织 React 代码库让 agent 易导航:用一致的组件文件夹与命名约定([name]/{index,types,[name].tsx}、kebab-case 文件名),让 agent 形成稳定预期、可靠定位;按功能(feature)而非按技术类型组织,让一个功能的代码聚在一处而非散落;以及把相关代码(组件、样式、测试、hook)就近放置,让 agent 改一个功能时手边就有它需要的一切。</p>\n"}